    },
    "Events are sent to Roam Control's maintainer-operated service and, in configured beta builds, TelemetryDeck. The self-hosted service receives ordinary HTTPS connection metadata, such as the source IP address, but the app does not include it in the event body.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Events are sent to Roam Control's maintainer-operated service and, in configured beta builds, TelemetryDeck. The self-hosted service receives ordinary HTTPS connection metadata, such as the source IP address, but the app does not include it in the event body."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事件会发送到由 Roam Control 维护者运营的服务；在已配置的测试构建中，也会发送到 TelemetryDeck。自托管服务会收到常规的 HTTPS 连接元数据（例如来源 IP 地址），但 App 不会把它写进事件正文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
