            "value": "Roam Control 丢失了位置会话信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control needs one private pairing before it can control location. We'll guide you through it next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control needs one private pairing before it can control location. We'll guide you through it next."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制位置前需要先完成一次私有配对，接下来我们会引导你完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control sends only a small, fixed set of anonymous activity counts when sharing is enabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control sends only a small, fixed set of anonymous activity counts when sharing is enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启共享后，Roam Control 只发送一小批固定格式的匿名活动计数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control should continue automatically. If it doesn't, tap Continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control should continue automatically. If it doesn't, tap Continue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通常会自动继续；若没有继续，请点“继续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control uses a narrow first-party sender instead of an analytics SDK, so extra device metadata is not added automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control uses a narrow first-party sender instead of an analytics SDK, so extra device metadata is not added automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control 使用范围有限的第一方发送器，而不是分析 SDK，因此不会自动附加额外的设备元数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control will end the route run and restore your real location. Your route progress will be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control will end the route run and restore your real location. Your route progress will be lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control 将结束路线跑步并恢复你的真实位置，路线进度会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control will end the simulated location and restore this iPhone's real location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control will end the simulated location and restore this iPhone's real location."
