          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roam Control 将结束模拟位置，并恢复这台 iPhone 的真实位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roam Control will end the simulated walk and restore your real location. Your route progress will be reset.": {
